  "description": "Contract surface lock (RUST-M0-0) for the M0A startup engine; re-baselined for M0B (RuntimeLifecycleState), M1-0 (capability contract set), and M1-A (capability registry implementation types). Snapshot of the librarian-contracts interop surface at implementation start; drift against this manifest fails the guard test (librarian-contracts/tests/contract_surface_manifest.rs).",
  "source": {
